---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ReadSheet from '../components/ReadSheet.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const sections = [
  { id: 'what-were-doing', title: 'What We’re Doing' },
  { id: 'still-encountering-a-barrier', title: 'Still Encountering a Barrier?' },
];
const mail = `mailto:${SITE.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('Accessibility Inquiry')}`;
---

<Base
  title="Accessibility Statement | Bridge AI Development and Ethics"
  description="Bridge AIDE is committed to making our site accessible to all. Read how we’re working to provide an inclusive digital experience."
  subscribeHref="/#subscribe"
>
  <ReadSheet title="Accessibility Statement" sections={sections}>
    <p class="lead">
      At Bridge AI Development and Ethics, we believe ethical technology starts with inclusive design, and that
      includes our website.
    </p>
    <p>
      We’re committed to making our digital spaces accessible to everyone, including people with disabilities. Our
      goal is to ensure that all visitors can engage fully with our content, events, and resources regardless of
      ability, device, or assistive technology.
    </p>

    <h2 id="what-were-doing">What We’re Doing</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to meet or exceed <a href="https://www.w3.org/WAI/standards-guidelines/wcag/">WCAG 2.1 AA accessibility standards</a>.
      This means we’re working to:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Provide clear, consistent navigation across our site</li>
      <li>Use descriptive alt text for images and meaningful link text</li>
      <li>Ensure readable contrast and scalable text</li>
      <li>Make forms and buttons screen-reader-friendly</li>
      <li>Design with keyboard navigation in mind</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 id="still-encountering-a-barrier">Still Encountering a Barrier?</h2>
    <p>
      We’re a student-led organization, and we’re learning as we go. If you experience any difficulty accessing our
      content or have suggestions for how we can improve, we want to hear from you.
    </p>
    <p>Please reach out to us at <a href={mail}>{SITE.email}</a> with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>The page or content you were trying to access</li>
      <li>The issue you encountered</li>
      <li>Any assistive technology or browser you’re using (if applicable)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We’ll do our best to fix the issue promptly and keep learning along the way.</p>
  </ReadSheet>
</Base>
